[
  {
    "id": 0,
    "properties": {
      "999008199": {
        "text": "（う～ん、今日はなんだか目が\n\u3000冴える夜……）",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "(Hmm, tonight my mind feels especially alert...)"
        }
      },
      "2072370017": {
        "text": "レスナ",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Resna"
        }
      }
    }
  },
  {
    "id": 1,
    "properties": {
      "999008199": {
        "text": "（本が一冊読み終わったから、気分転換に\n\u3000散歩に来てみたけど――）",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "(I just finished a book, so I came out for a walk to clear my head, but—)"
        }
      },
      "2072370017": {
        "text": "レスナ",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Resna"
        }
      }
    }
  },
  {
    "id": 2,
    "properties": {
      "999008199": {
        "text": "あれ？\u3000アルビーナ？",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Huh? Alvina?"
        }
      },
      "2072370017": {
        "text": "レスナ",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Resna"
        }
      }
    }
  },
  {
    "id": 3,
    "properties": {
      "999008199": {
        "text": "あっ！\u3000レスナ！",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Oh! Resna!"
        }
      },
      "2072370017": {
        "text": "アルビーナ",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Alvina"
        }
      }
    }
  },
  {
    "id": 4,
    "properties": {
      "999008199": {
        "text": "何か書いてたの？\u3000もしかしてレシピ？",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Were you writing something? A recipe, perhaps?"
        }
      },
      "2072370017": {
        "text": "レスナ",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Resna"
        }
      }
    }
  },
  {
    "id": 5,
    "properties": {
      "999008199": {
        "text": "いえ、これは……日記っす！",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "No, this is... my diary!"
        }
      },
      "2072370017": {
        "text": "アルビーナ",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Alvina"
        }
      }
    }
  },
  {
    "id": 6,
    "properties": {
      "999008199": {
        "text": "日記をつけているんだ",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "You keep a diary?"
        }
      },
      "2072370017": {
        "text": "レスナ",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Resna"
        }
      }
    }
  },
  {
    "id": 7,
    "properties": {
      "999008199": {
        "text": "……レスナ、言ってくれたじゃん？\n案内人の仕事が好きなんだねって",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "...Remember what you said to me, Resna? That I love being a guide?"
        }
      },
      "2072370017": {
        "text": "アルビーナ",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Alvina"
        }
      }
    }
  },
  {
    "id": 8,
    "properties": {
      "999008199": {
        "text": "アタシ……それを言われるまで、\n自分ではまったく意識してなくって……",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "I... until you said that, I hadn't been conscious of it at all..."
        }
      },
      "2072370017": {
        "text": "アルビーナ",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Alvina"
        }
      }
    }
  },
  {
    "id": 9,
    "properties": {
      "999008199": {
        "text": "言われて初めて、案内人のお仕事が\n好きなのかもって思ったんだ",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "It wasn't until you pointed it out that I thought maybe I do love my work as a guide."
        }
      },
      "2072370017": {
        "text": "アルビーナ",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Alvina"
        }
      }
    }
  },
  {
    "id": 10,
    "properties": {
      "999008199": {
        "text": "退屈だと思ってた日常の中に、\nまさか『好き』があったなんて……",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "To think there was something I \"loved\" in the daily life I thought was boring..."
        }
      },
      "2072370017": {
        "text": "アルビーナ",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Alvina"
        }
      }
    }
  },
  {
    "id": 11,
    "properties": {
      "999008199": {
        "text": "そんなの思いもしなかったから",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "I never would have imagined that."
        }
      },
      "2072370017": {
        "text": "アルビーナ",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Alvina"
        }
      }
    }
  },
  {
    "id": 12,
    "properties": {
      "999008199": {
        "text": "それで……もしかしたら、他にも\n無自覚な『好き』があるのかなって思ったんだ",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "So... I started wondering if there might be other things I love without realizing it."
        }
      },
      "2072370017": {
        "text": "アルビーナ",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Alvina"
        }
      }
    }
  },
  {
    "id": 13,
    "properties": {
      "999008199": {
        "text": "だから、日記に色々と書き起こしてみて、\nこの退屈な日々を見つめ直そうと思って",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "That's why I'm writing all sorts of things in my diary, trying to take a fresh look at these supposedly boring days."
        }
      },
      "2072370017": {
        "text": "アルビーナ",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Alvina"
        }
      }
    }
  },
  {
    "id": 14,
    "properties": {
      "999008199": {
        "text": "素敵なことだよ、アルビーナ",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "That's wonderful, Alvina."
        }
      },
      "2072370017": {
        "text": "レスナ",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Resna"
        }
      }
    }
  },
  {
    "id": 15,
    "properties": {
      "999008199": {
        "text": "……ありがとね",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "...Thank you."
        }
      },
      "2072370017": {
        "text": "アルビーナ",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Alvina"
        }
      }
    }
  },
  {
    "id": 16,
    "properties": {
      "999008199": {
        "text": "え？",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Huh?"
        }
      },
      "2072370017": {
        "text": "レスナ",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Resna"
        }
      }
    }
  },
  {
    "id": 17,
    "properties": {
      "999008199": {
        "text": "レスナのおかげで、アタシ……\n今までより島での生活を好きになれそう",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Thanks to you, I... I think I can enjoy life on this island more than before."
        }
      },
      "2072370017": {
        "text": "アルビーナ",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Alvina"
        }
      }
    }
  },
  {
    "id": 18,
    "properties": {
      "999008199": {
        "text": "ふふ……どういたしまして",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Hehe... you're welcome."
        }
      },
      "2072370017": {
        "text": "レスナ",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Resna"
        }
      }
    }
  },
  {
    "id": 19,
    "properties": {
      "999008199": {
        "text": "でも、それはそれ！\u3000これはこれ！\nアタシは島の外へ冒険の旅に出る！",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "But that's that! And this is this! I'm still going on an adventure beyond this island!"
        }
      },
      "2072370017": {
        "text": "アルビーナ",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Alvina"
        }
      }
    }
  },
  {
    "id": 20,
    "properties": {
      "999008199": {
        "text": "アタシが気付いた『好き』も、\nアタシがずっと抱いていた『憧れ』も――",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Both the \"love\" I've discovered and the \"dream\" I've always had—"
        }
      },
      "2072370017": {
        "text": "アルビーナ",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Alvina"
        }
      }
    }
  },
  {
    "id": 21,
    "properties": {
      "999008199": {
        "text": "どっちも大切な想いだから！",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "They're both precious feelings to me!"
        }
      },
      "2072370017": {
        "text": "アルビーナ",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Alvina"
        }
      }
    }
  },
  {
    "id": 22,
    "properties": {
      "999008199": {
        "text": "……そっか。よかった。\n少しは先輩らしくできたのかな",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "...I see. I'm glad. Maybe I managed to act like a proper senior for once."
        }
      },
      "2072370017": {
        "text": "レスナ",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Resna"
        }
      }
    }
  },
  {
    "id": 23,
    "properties": {
      "999008199": {
        "text": "え？",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Huh?"
        }
      },
      "2072370017": {
        "text": "アルビーナ",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Alvina"
        }
      }
    }
  },
  {
    "id": 24,
    "properties": {
      "999008199": {
        "text": "ううん、なんでもない",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "No, it's nothing."
        }
      },
      "2072370017": {
        "text": "レスナ",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Resna"
        }
      }
    }
  },
  {
    "id": 25,
    "properties": {
      "999008199": {
        "text": "（シャリステラ先輩やライザ先輩。\n\u3000色んな先輩から、色んなことを教わった）",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "(Miss Shallistera, Miss Ryza... I've learned so many things from so many mentors.)"
        }
      },
      "2072370017": {
        "text": "レスナ",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Resna"
        }
      }
    }
  },
  {
    "id": 26,
    "properties": {
      "999008199": {
        "text": "（今度は私の番。\n\u3000しっかりしてる子だから\n\u3000教えられることは少ないかもしれない）",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "(Now it's my turn. She's already so dependable, so there might not be much I can teach her.)"
        }
      },
      "2072370017": {
        "text": "レスナ",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Resna"
        }
      }
    }
  },
  {
    "id": 27,
    "properties": {
      "999008199": {
        "text": "（それでも、できることを伝えよう。\n\u3000いつか彼女の前にも、大きな壁が\n\u3000立ちはだかるかもしれないから）",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "(Even so, I want to share what I can. Because someday, she might face a huge obstacle of her own.)"
        }
      },
      "2072370017": {
        "text": "レスナ",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Resna"
        }
      }
    }
  },
  {
    "id": 28,
    "properties": {
      "999008199": {
        "text": "（その壁を、乗り越えられるように――）",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "(So that when that wall appears—she'll be able to overcome it.)"
        }
      },
      "2072370017": {
        "text": "レスナ",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Resna"
        }
      }
    }
  }
]